OL,3,GNEWSACritical incident declared before
OL,4,Ahospital strikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of Greater Manchester's largest NHS
OL,7,Ftrusts across the region has declared a
OL,8,Fcritical incident ahead of three days
OL,9,Fof strikes.
OL,11,FMore than 350 workers at Salford Royal
OL,12,FHospital, Royal Oldham Hospital,
OL,13,FRochdale Infirmary and Fairfield
OL,14,FHospital in Bury are due to strike on
OL,15,FMonday, Wednesday and Friday in a
OL,16,Fdispute over pay for covering staff
OL,17,Fshortages.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
