OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACritical incident declared before
OL,4,Ahospital strikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Northern Care Alliance NHS
OL,7,FFoundation Trust (NCA) said declaring a
OL,8,Fcritical incident would help it get
OL,9,Fextra support to keep urgent surgery
OL,10,Frunning, although some procedures would
OL,11,Fbe postponed.
OL,13,FUnison said it remained willing to
OL,14,Fnegotiate with the trust, where four
OL,15,Fstrikes were held in June.
